@page
@model MossHarper.Pages.ContactModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Contact";
}
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow light">Start a conversation</p><h1>What challenge are you trying to resolve?</h1><p>Tell us a little about your situation and we will be in touch.</p></div></section>
<section id="contact" class="contact-section section-pad"><div class="container contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p><h2>Independent advice starts with a conversation.</h2><p>Share the nature of the property or operational challenge, the people involved and any immediate timescales. Please avoid sending confidential documents through this form.</p><div class="contact-note"><strong>What happens next</strong><p>Your enquiry goes to the Moss Harper team. A response time will be published once the business contact arrangements are confirmed.</p></div></div>
    <div><partial name="_ContactForm" model="Model" /></div>
</div></section>
